   "kind": 2,
   "value": "expected15 = -(GammaAntisymmetricProductHold[{CUDHold, GammaDUHold[projectedNSOutAntiIndex]}, alpha, beta] projectedNSOutAnti)/(Sqrt[2] (wb - zb));\nactual15 = OPEProjected[0, 1][R[St[{alpha, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, zb]], R[St[{beta, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, wb]], \"RandomSeed\" -> 1234];\ntest15 = testReport[\"Test 15 (projected St-St to e^-phit psit)\", Simplify[actual15 - expected15] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
