  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "expected15b = (GammaAntisymmetricProductHold[{CDUHold, GammaUDHold[projectedNSOutHoloNegPictureIndex]}, alpha, beta] projectedNSOutHoloNegPicture)/(Sqrt[2] (z - w)^3);\nactual15b = OPEProjected[-1, 0][R[S[{alpha, \"antichiral\"}, -3/2, {}, 0, z]], R[S[{beta, \"antichiral\"}, -3/2, {}, 0, w]], \"RandomSeed\" -> 1234];\ntest15b = testReport[\"Test 15b (projected Sbar[-3/2]-Sbar[-3/2] to e^-3phi psi)\", Simplify[actual15b - expected15b] === 0];",
